    "base": "I'm getting supplies for the next time I make this dish. I need a spare of the item I mean among these two things beside the sink: the draining bowl or the cutting board. Match its general shape and overall colour; any size or material is fine. Also add the same kind of fresh whole fruit I use for the juice in this dish. Any brand or pack size is fine."
